":2,"retweet_count":6},"text":"What makes people want or intend to have more kids?\n\nWell, @PeterRFB and @DrJasonCarroll and I show in a new @FamStudies report that one simple answer may be: friends who are more supportive of them having kids!\n\nPeer influences matter for fertility. https://t.co/IgkzsfTzGe","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112560833070854353"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112560648005484545"]},"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:05:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112560723603632217"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":108,"id":"2031457713868386305","start":95,"username":"NASAMoonBase"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tal41Kyght","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112560723603632217/video/1","media_key":"13_2112560648005484545","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/tal41Kyght"}]},"id":"2112560723603632217","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":121,"impression_count":289193,"like_count":1963,"quote_count":43,"reply_count":152,"retweet_count":308},"text":"There's a lot of ground to cover when you're building a Moon Base. \n\nDuring the first phase of @NASAMoonBase development, robotic rovers will gather new details about the lunar South Pole region, while lunar terrain vehicles will extend the reach of each Artemis mission. https://t.co/tal41Kyght","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112560723603632217"},{"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:00:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112559638579499258"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Q3 2026 Financial and Operational Results","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":96,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1PKqrNbLZbPGb","images":[{"height":658,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112551855788023810/FFsART3d?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112551855788023810/FFsART3d?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":73,"status":200,"title":"SpaceX","unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/b