rtemis Accords during a ceremony in Samarkand on Monday, committing to the practical principles","display_url":"go.nasa.gov/4hWoI2z","end":187,"expanded_url":"https://go.nasa.gov/4hWoI2z","images":[{"height":2250,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112553122706980864/yW6-cui7?format=jpg&name=orig","width":4000},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112553122706980864/yW6-cui7?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":164,"status":200,"title":"NASA Welcomes Uzbekistan as Newest Artemis Accords Signatory - NASA","unwound_url":"https://www.nasa.gov/organizations/oiir/artemis-accords/nasa-welcomes-uzbekistan-as-newest-artemis-accords-signatory/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASA&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=1024354216","url":"https://t.co/xjbRr1KmLH"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/sXI59ZklOk","end":211,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112553116390269175/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112553113294974976","start":188,"url":"https://t.co/sXI59ZklOk"}]},"id":"2112553116390269175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":409517,"like_count":1044,"quote_count":15,"reply_count":83,"retweet_count":120},"text":"Welcome to the Artemis Accords, Uzbekistan 🇺🇿\n\nUzbekistan has joined 76 other nations around the world by committing to the peaceful and safe exploration of space. https://t.co/xjbRr1KmLH https://t.co/sXI59ZklOk","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2112553116390269175"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:31:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112552245548155279"],"id":"2112552245548155279","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":3211,"like_count":66,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"i think it's reasonable to say that most Americans do have competing, dual loyalties of some kind, and we should be able to discuss this nonpejoratively. in a \"choose one\" scenario i choose my church over my country. that's a kind of dual loyalty. saying that isn't insulting me.","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112552245548155279"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112551099613794305"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112551394456563762"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":105,"id":"1600613745453158401","start":94,"username":"MoreBirths"},{"end":261,"id":"1665459757","start":250,"username":"FamStudies"},{"end":271,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":262,"username":"PeterRFB"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/CNk2PIPSu7","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112551394456563762/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112551099613794305","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/CNk2PIPSu7"}]},"id":"2112551394456563762","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1735,"like_count":26,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"We all know \"culture matters\" for fertility. But what actually makes a \"pronatal culture\" (as @MoreBirths often talks about)?\n\nEmpirically, a big part of it is just having friends who will go out of their way to support and celebrate a new baby.\n\ncc @FamStudies @PeterRFB https://t.co/CNk2PIPSu7","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112551394456563762"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112547668459180032","3_2112548729840349184","3_2112549106698600448"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:19:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112549381635194931"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":29,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":20,"username":"PeterRFB"},{"end":63,"id":"1665459757","start":52,"username":"FamStudies"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JwJrLB466S","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112547668459180032","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/JwJrLB466S"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JwJrLB466S","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112548729840349184","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/JwJrLB466S"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JwJrLB466S","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112549106698600448","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/JwJrLB466S"}]},"id":"2112549381635194931","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1645,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"One VERY cool thing @PeterRFB and I did for our new @FamStudies report was survey people about the celebrities they admired.\n\nBut.... that got us curious!\n\nWhat was the real general fertility behavior of social and cultural elites? How would we know?\n\nTo assess this, we scraped https://t.co/JwJrLB466S","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112549381635194931"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112544840818868226"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:02:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112545113633419656"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":254,"id":"1665459757","start":243,"username":"FamStudies"},{"end":264,"id":"1887207443257528320","start":255,"username":"PeterRFB"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/jTxyubbtoR","end":288,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112545113633419656/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112544840818868226","start":265,"url":"https://t.co/jTxyubbtoR"}]},"id":"2112545113633419656","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2622,"like_count":43,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":8},"text":"Where do people most expect their friends would help them out with a new baby?\n\nDefinitely not Japan or Korea!\n\nIsraelis planning a first birth, however, anticipate getting LOTS of help!\n\nMaybe that helps explain Israel's unique fertility?\ncc @FamStudies @PeterRFB https://t.co/jTxyubbtoR","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112545113633419656"},{"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-20T13:56:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112543527481876848"],"id":"2112543527481876848","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count"